## Workspace Layout

This checkout is the Rust workspace root itself. There is no nested `codex-rs`
directory. The core crate is under `core/src`; for example the shrinker is at
`core/src/context_manager/tool_output.rs`.

## Task

Write `CONTEXT-FILTERS.md` explaining:

1. every filter that runs over conversation history before a model request;
2. the exact gate for each filter, with file and line references;
3. whether each can fire mid-turn or only at a turn boundary, and why;
4. evidence for why the tool-output shrinker never fires in real sessions,
